stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NotRequested
    NotRequested --> Queued: scene selected
    Queued --> Loading: async preload starts
    Loading --> Decoded: resource stream decoded
    Decoded --> NativeCached: SKImage or shader cached
    NativeCached --> InUse: scene active
    InUse --> RecentlyUsed: scene transition away
    RecentlyUsed --> InUse: scene returns soon
    RecentlyUsed --> Evictable: memory pressure or cache limit
    Evictable --> Disposed: release native resource
    Disposed --> NotRequested

    Loading --> Failed: missing or corrupt asset
    Failed --> Placeholder: use fallback
    Placeholder --> NotRequested

